s that allow you to build up segments of your body, dress it in armor and equip it with machine guns that will help you in a difficult fight against enemies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207040/extras/5d98fedfff35245e7b6334c6d83a32ee.poster.avif?t=1732258558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207040/extras/5d98fedfff35245e7b6334c6d83a32ee.webm?t=1732258558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207040/extras/5d98fedfff35245e7b6334c6d83a32ee.mp4?t=1732258558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Game Features: bosses, pumping abilities, weapon upgrade.",
